{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/364056-associate-integrate-identity-theft-interlock-idea-help","id":364056,"title":"Associate & Integrate + Identity Theft interlock idea help","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-08T20:22:04-08:00","id":364056,"title":"Associate & Integrate + Identity Theft interlock idea help","content":"I'm currently trying to come up with a good idea for a interlock of Associate &amp; Integrate + Identity Theft. I'm thinking something with you identity them some one the target knows with out seeing them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T22:15:49-08:00","id":364121,"title":"","content":"Setting aside the need for more information about the demon whose Cipher this Interlock is going into, &quot;find a person who knows [person whose identity you're borrowing]&quot; seems within the scope of Special Someone.<br /> <br /> Is this the first Interlock? Which Embed comes first?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-09T04:52:11-08:00","id":364239,"title":"","content":"Yeah, more info would be good. Context for a Cipher is crazy-important. Virtue, Vice and Agenda would be helpful. Final secret, if you have it, is also great.<br /> <br /> So, Identity Theft is a temporary change, complete with altered Merits, whereas Associate And Integrate is permanent shift of one's own Cover (Merits included). Of course, Identity Theft requires you touch a target. Best to pare them down to conceptual underpinnings - Associate and Integrate is about change and relationships. Identity Theft about identity, stealing and disguise, <br /> <br /> A few ideas - <br /> <i>Temporarily</i> change details of another person's identity/Cover/appearance (resisted power) by touching them. Can be used aggressively or to disguise allies. Or even to reward people. <br /> An adaptive camouflage where the character can change details of their disguise (though this does kinda touch on a lot of existing Embeds). <br /> Steal a person's relationships, probably temporarily (a little similar to Unperson, but dissimilar enough). Or steal one of them permanently. Good for a nasty Tempter. <br /> A power that lets you appear as one of a person's relationships, such as their wife or brother (again, similar to existing Embeds). <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T13:39:34-08:00","id":368905,"title":"","content":"<b>Associate &amp; Integrate and is first. The demon is a social manipulator. The demon is in the body of a little Asian cosplayer who has her own youtube channel and fame 1. This is the demons first interlock</b><br /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}